1,Holoholo - Hartenberger World Musical Instrument Collection,https://wmic.net/african-cultures/holoholo/,The Holoholo people live in southeastern Democratic Republic of Congo and western Tanzania (shore of Lake Tanganyika). Holoholo economy during the height of late 19th century expansion was directly related to the eastern African slave trade. The Holoholo were employed by the Arabs to guard the lakeside ports and warehouses where gold and ivory were stored to await shipment across the lake ...,Holoholo,Niger-Congo
